---
title: Schedule
permalink: /schedule/index.html
description: Plano Wildcats hockey schedule — games, results, and stats.
layout: page
---

<p>
  Varsity competes in the <strong>{{ season.league.division }}</strong> division and the Scholastic
  Division competes in the <strong>{{ season.league.jvDivision }}</strong> division of the
  {{ season.league.name }} during {{ season.name }}.
  Live schedules, results, and standings are maintained on the official league site.
</p>

<aside class="league-links flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-3xs)">
  <p class="league-links__label">Home Rink</p>
  <p><strong>Children's Health StarCenter Plano</strong><br>4020 W Plano Pkwy, Plano, TX 75093</p>
</aside>

<div class="flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">

  <section>
    <h2>Varsity</h2>
    <div class="cluster" style="--gutter: var(--space-xs)">
      <a href="{{ season.varsity.scheduleUrl }}" class="button" data-button-variant="primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Season Schedule</a>
      <a href="{{ season.varsity.scoresUrl }}" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Results</a>
      <a href="{{ season.varsity.statsUrl }}" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stats</a>
      <a href="/teams/varsity/" class="button">Roster</a>
    </div>
    {% if season.varsity.subscribeUrl %}
      <div class="cluster calendar-subscribe" style="--gutter: var(--space-xs)">
        <span class="calendar-subscribe__label">Add to your calendar:</span>
        <a href="{{ season.varsity.subscribeUrl }}" class="button" data-small-button>Apple / Outlook</a>
        <a href="{{ season.varsity.googleCalendarUrl }}" class="button" data-small-button target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Calendar</a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Scholastic Division</h2>
    <div class="cluster" style="--gutter: var(--space-xs)">
      <a href="{{ season.juniorVarsity.scheduleUrl }}" class="button" data-button-variant="primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Season Schedule</a>
      <a href="{{ season.juniorVarsity.scoresUrl }}" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Results</a>
      <a href="{{ season.juniorVarsity.statsUrl }}" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stats</a>
      <a href="/teams/junior-varsity/" class="button">Roster</a>
    </div>
    {% if season.juniorVarsity.subscribeUrl %}
      <div class="cluster calendar-subscribe" style="--gutter: var(--space-xs)">
        <span class="calendar-subscribe__label">Add to your calendar:</span>
        <a href="{{ season.juniorVarsity.subscribeUrl }}" class="button" data-small-button>Apple / Outlook</a>
        <a href="{{ season.juniorVarsity.googleCalendarUrl }}" class="button" data-small-button target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Calendar</a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

</div>
